note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note wpcheck: the Omega test driver for wpatch (replaces check.py). CPU only. Built by wpbuild as
note wpcheck-all.om = om2, the vendored SHA-256 layout and functions, this file.
note Usage: wpcheck small BUILD WORK ORACLE      own-model fixtures made here with BUILD/ollm
note        wpcheck real BUILD WORK ORACLE CK    the read-only round40 checkpoint CK
note BUILD holds wpatch and ollm. WORK must not exist; it is created 0700 and holds every fixture.
note ORACLE is wporacle.py, run as /usr/bin/python3 ORACLE REQUEST. It only computes hashlib
note SHA-256 and IEEE f32 cast digests of files named in REQUEST; every comparison, exit code, fixture,
note refusal and the PASS/FAIL verdict is decided here. Fixture rehashes (FNV, manifest and binding
note digests) use the vendored Omega SHA-256, not the oracle.
note Output is plain text: RUN argv, the child's stdout as `| ` lines (its stderr passes through),
note EXIT got want elapsed_ns, then PASS or FAIL lines. The last line is
note `WPCHECK PASS checks=N commands=M` (exit 0) or `WPCHECK FAIL ...` (exit 1); 2 is usage.

global sb uchar 131072
global sl ulong 256
global pb uchar 4096
global pn ulong 1
global av uchar 8192
global ap ulong 2
global stb uchar 4
global ob uchar 4194304
global obn ulong 1
global oo uchar 65536
global ol ulong 1024
global oln ulong 1
global rq uchar 65536
global rqn ulong 2
global dig uchar 32
global dg uchar 32
global cnt ulong 4
global tt ulong 1536
global tn ulong 2
global rix ulong 64
global rbt ulong 64
global rcn ulong 1
global hh ulong 8
global mf ulong 16
global ca uchar 65536
global cb uchar 65536
const SWP ulong 0
const SOLLM ulong 1
const SWORK ulong 2
const SORC ulong 3
const SBASE ulong 4
const SEDIT ulong 5
const SPF ulong 6
const SRF ulong 7
const STRAIN ulong 8
